WEBVTT

NOTE Caption track for a silent video. The cues describe what is on screen.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.400
shopware-mcp. Talk to your Shopware shop. An MCP server for the Shopware 6 Admin API.

00:05.400 --> 00:09.000
A terminal. The user asks: Is everything okay with the shop? The agent calls shop_audit.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.800
The audit finds 2 critical and 4 warning items: paid orders not shipped, a storefront in maintenance mode, an expired promotion still active.

00:14.800 --> 00:20.600
One small server. Shopware does the counting. Tools with model-friendly descriptions, most read-only, audit checks in one call, guarded writes.

00:20.600 --> 00:25.600
Read-only by default. Every write is a dry run first and shows the exact request. A write budget caps the rest. Nothing deletes.

00:25.600 --> 00:30.000
npx shopware-mcp init. Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, VS Code, Zed, Docker. github.com/bnymnDev/shopware-mcp. MIT, no telemetry, Shopware 6.6 and 6.7.
